  "content": "\n\n<div><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/sablebarehanded.png\" alt=\"图标\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"cloth-config-api\" height=\"56\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbarehanded%253floader%253dneoforge%2523download\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Hyperbole-Devs/vectors/refs/heads/neoforge_badges/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\" height=\"56\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbarehanded%253floader%253dfabric%2523download\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\" height=\"56\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbarehanded\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/JuaanP/SableBarehanded\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"40\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fjuaanp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"40\"></a></div>\n<hr>\n<h1>徒手</h1>\n<p><em>一款基于 Sable 的模组，允许玩家徒手物理拆卸、移动和旋转方块。无需任何工具！</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>🧱 拆卸与搬运</h3>\n<p>| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/pumpkin_detach.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<strong>沉浸式物理：</strong> 蹲下并向后退，同时按住左右键即可拉动！|<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/chest_detach.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<strong>智能连接：</strong> 自动检测并安全拆卸相连的结构（如双箱）。|</p>\n<h3>🫳 抓取、推动与旋转</h3>\n<p>| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/survival.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<strong>抓取与旋转：</strong> 在空中悬停子区块，并使用自定义按键自由旋转。|<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/car_push.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<strong>推动与交互：</strong> 施加物理力量来移动重物、载具或建筑结构。|</p>\n<h3>🔨 建造与拆解</h3>\n<p>| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/slam.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<strong>拆解：</strong> 将抓取的子区块猛砸至方块上，或按 <strong>[Q]</strong> 将其直接放回世界。|<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/place_toggle.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<strong>物理放置：</strong> 按 <strong>[X]</strong> 切换放置模式，放置的方块将直接作为物理实体生成。|</p>\n<h3>⚔️ 生存友好</h3>\n<p>| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/strength01.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n💪 <strong>重量与张力：</strong> 结构过重重时会大幅拖慢速度，若拉得太远连接可能会断裂。|<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/strength02.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n🧪 <strong>药水与饥饿：</strong> 力量药水可倍增你的举重能力，而搬运重物会真实消耗饥饿值。|</p>\n<h3>🌌 创造友好</h3>\n<p>| <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/creative01.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n🦾 <strong>无限力量：</strong> 获得无限力量与最大结构稳定性，突破所有限制。|<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/creative02.gif\" alt=\"\"><br>\n🔭 <strong>无界范围：</strong> 几乎可以从任意距离抓取、拉动并操控巨型结构。|</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>🎮 沉浸式操作</h3>\n<p><sup>确保你使用 <strong>空手</strong> 才能与物理引擎交互：</sup></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>控制方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>抓取（切换）</strong></td>\n<td>按 <strong>[G]</strong> 切换抓取开关，无需按住按键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>抓取（按住）</strong></td>\n<td>同时按住 <strong>左键 + 右键</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>调整距离</strong></td>\n<td>滚动鼠标滚轮或使用 <strong>[-]</strong> / <strong>[=]</strong> 键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>组装方块</strong></td>\n<td>对着世界方块按住 <strong>潜行</strong> + <strong>左键 + 右键</strong>，然后向后退即可拉动！</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>拆卸子区块方块</strong></td>\n<td><em>对着已抓取的子区块按住 <strong>潜行</strong> + <strong>[Alt]</strong> + <strong>左键 + 右键</strong>，然后拉动！</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>举起可交互物品（如箱子）</strong></td>\n<td><em>先按住 <strong>左键</strong>，再按 <strong>右键</strong> 以避免打开界面。</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>举起瞬间破坏方块（如TNT）</strong></td>\n<td><em>先按住 <strong>右键</strong>，再按 <strong>左键</strong> 以避免破坏。</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>旋转</strong></td>\n<td>按住 <strong>[R]</strong> 并移动鼠标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>切换支点</strong></td>\n<td>旋转时按住 <strong>[Alt]</strong>（重心 ↔ 抓取点）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>拆解</strong></td>\n<td>持有子区块时按 <strong>[Q]</strong>（或将其猛砸至方块上！）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>合并子区块</strong></td>\n<td>按住 <strong>[Alt]</strong> + 按 <strong>[Q]</strong> 合并对齐的子区块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>物理放置</strong></td>\n<td>按 <strong>[X]</strong> 切换 — 放置的方块将作为物理实体生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h4>⚙️ 完全可配置</h4>\n<p>通过游戏内配置菜单（Cloth Config），你可以自定义本模组的各个方面，以适配你的游玩风格或服务器需求。</p>",
